{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Grove Training procs Aftershock from triggered heals and offhand melee (#13112)",
  "contract": "Issue #13112 (class 31 Primalist, Grovekeeper): Grove Training 92150 ('All melee damage, or healing done, now has a 10% chance to grant you Aftershock') had AttributesMask 0 in spell_proc, so Aura::GetProcEffectMask silently dropped every triggered melee hit (Wildclaw Offhand 504240) and triggered heal (Hammer of Life 806073, Sacred Grove recovery 800179, Mountain's Reverence 712433, Elemental Cascade 570051). Live combat logs confirm a flat 10% per-hit/per-heal-target roll with no ICD, no bad-luck protection, triggered heals/melee included, and periodic HoTs (Nature's Blessing 807561) excluded. Setting AttributesMask = 2 (PROC_ATTR_TRIGGERED_CAN_PROC) enables triggered melee and heal procs while preserving the 10% base chance and keeping periodic HoTs excluded. A native SPELLMOD_CHANCE_OF_SUCCESS mutant forces 92150 to 100% for deterministic verification.",
